{"question_text": {"৪৯তম বিসিএস ⎯ ফলিত গণিত (৫৬১)": [{"id": "1", "question": "১) The Laplace transform is called a linear operator because", "option1": "It removes exponential terms", "option2": "It converts integration into differentiation", "option3": "It satisfies L{aF<sub>1</sub>(t) + bF<sub>2</sub>(t)} = bL{F<sub>1</sub>(t)} + aL{F<sub>2</sub>(t)}", "option4": "None of this", "answer": "4", "exp": "<p><u><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/image_2025-08-18_105904276.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"741\" height=\"129\"></u></p>"}, {"id": "2", "question": "২) Which of the following is the general formula for Laplace transform of t<sup>n</sup>?", "option1": "n!/s<sup>n</sup>", "option2": "n/s<sup>n + 1</sup>", "option3": "n!/s<sup>n + 1</sup>", "option4": "(n+1)!/s<sup>n + 1</sup>", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/image_2025-08-18_114529787.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"459\" height=\"102\"></p>"}, {"id": "3", "question": "৩) <img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/image_2025-08-18_120148983.png\" width=\"642\" height=\"74\" alt=\"\">", "option1": "s &lt; a", "option2": "s &gt; a", "option3": "s = a", "option4": "For all s", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/image_2025-08-18_120351603.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"845\" height=\"150\"></p>"}, {"id": "4", "question": "৪) If f(s) = 1/(s - 2)​, then the original function f(t) is:", "option1": "&nbsp;e<sup>- 2t</sup>", "option2": "e<sup>2t</sup>", "option3": "cos(2t)", "option4": "sin(2t)", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p>From L{e<sup>at</sup>} = 1/(s - a)​. If f(s) = 1/(s - 2)​, then a = 2, so the time-domain function is e<sup>2t</sup>.</p>"}, {"id": "5", "question": "৫) If F<sub>1</sub>(t) = 1, F<sub>2</s