"option1": "1/s", "option2": "1/(s<sup>2</sup> + 1)", "option3": "s/(s<sup>2</sup> + 1)", "option4": "Undefined", "answer": "1", "exp": "<p><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/image_2025-08-18_130006925.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"686\" height=\"123\"></p>"}, {"id": "9", "question": "৯) Find L{e<sup>4t</sup>cosh⁡(t)}.", "option1": "s/(s<sup>2 </sup>- 1)", "option2": "(s - 4)/(s<sup>2 </sup>- 1)", "option3": "(s - 4)/{(s - 4)<sup>2 </sup>- 1}", "option4": "None of these", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/image_2025-08-18_132506608.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"782\" height=\"254\"></p>"}, {"id": "10", "question": "১০) <img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/image_2025-08-18_234607278.png\" width=\"367\" height=\"104\" alt=\"\">", "option1": "1/(s<sup>2 </sup>+ 1)", "option2": "s/(s<sup>2 </sup>+ 1)", "option3": "1/s(s<sup>2 </sup>+ 1)", "option4": "s/(s<sup>3 </sup>+ 1)", "answer": "1", "exp": "<p><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/image_2025-08-18_234850396.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"387\" height=\"134\"></p>"}, {"id": "11", "question": "১১) <img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/image_2025-08-18_235013557.png\" width=\"421\" height=\"143\" alt=\"\">", "option1": "1/(s<sup>2 </sup>+ 1)", "option2": "tan<sup>-1</sup>(s)/s", "option3": "π/2s​", "option4": "tan<sup>-1</sup>(1/s)/s", "answer": "4", "exp": "<p><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/image_2025-08-18_235406960.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"436\" height=\"190\"></p>"}, {"id": "12", "question": "১২) &nbsp;If L{F<sub>1</sub>(t)} = f<sub>1</sub>(s) and L{F<sub>2</sub>(t)} = f<sub>2</